{"sourceUrl":"https://dqgc.gxu.edu.cn/info/1016/4883.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:50.488407+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://dqgc.gxu.edu.cn/info/1016/4883.htm","html":"<div><div>\n\n<div>\n<p><span><span><strong><span></span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>为做好我</span></span><span><span>院</span></span><span><span>接收推荐免试攻读硕士、直接攻读博士学位研究生（推免硕士生、直博生）复试录取工作，依据教育部相关文件</span></span><span><span>和</span></span><span><span>《</span><span>2027年广西大学接收推荐免试研究生复试录取工作办法》，结合我院实际，制定本复试细则。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>一、</span></span><span><span>招生规模管控</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>一</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>招生计划</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>推免硕士生：</span></span></strong><span><span>各专业接收推免生（硕士推免）总人数不超过本专业硕士招生指标</span><span>50%；</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>直博生：</span></span></strong><span><span>直博生录取人数不超过本专业博士招生指标</span><span>30%（</span></span><span><span>直博生仅限有博士授予权的学术学位专业招收）。</span></span></p>\n<div>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>专业类型</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>专业代码及名称</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>可招收推免生类型</span></span></strong></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>学术型</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>080800电气工程</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>硕士生、直博生</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>专业学位</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>085801电气工程</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>硕士生</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span><span>专业学位</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>085406控制工程</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span><span>硕士生</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>二</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>基本原则</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>推免硕士生、直博生复试录取工作坚持德才兼备、全面衡量、择优录取、宁缺毋滥，遵循公开公平公正原则，全部流程在全国推免服务系统完成。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>、申请基本条件</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>一</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>推免硕士生</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法的中国公民，且满足以下条件：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1.在目前就读学校取得教育部推荐免试研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.研究兴趣浓厚，有较强创新意识和创新能力及牢固的专业基本知识；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.诚实守信、学风端正、不存在任何违反学术道德和专业伦理的行为，以及在本科学习期间未受过任何行政处罚或处分；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4.预计能够按时取得本科毕业证书、学士学位证书；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5.身体健康符合国家研究生招生体检标准。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（二）直博生</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.需满足上述推免硕士生申请基本条件；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.具备较强科研兴趣与博士培养潜质；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>.须提前与意向博士生导师沟通，导师具备当年直博招生资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>三、申请与复试</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（一）申请环节</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>1.志愿填报：</span></span></strong><span><span>考生在全国推免服务系统填报广西大学志愿，并按</span></span><span><span>我</span></span><span><span>院材料审核小组要求提交全套申请材料。其中，</span></span><span><span>直博生</span></span><span><span>须额外提交</span></span><span><span>附录</span><span>1</span></span><span><span>《广西大学博士研究生学业研修规划报告》</span></span><span><span>，内容应体现攻读博士阶段的学习目标、课题研究的思考与准备、预期取得的学术成就。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>2.</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>审核与确认：</span></span></strong><span><span>我</span></span><span><span>院材料审核小组完成材料真实性、完整性核验，确定复试名单并发送复试通知。考生须在规定时间确认，逾期视为放弃；考生对材料审核结果有异议，可向</span></span><span><span>我</span></span><span><span>院材料审核小组实名申诉。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>3.需要提交的申请材料：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>学生证、身份证复印件各一份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>国家级外语</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>英语</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>考试成绩或合格证书复印件一份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>加盖所在学校教务部门公章的本科学习成绩单一份（原件）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>政审表（在我校研究生院网站下载专区下载</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>可</span></span><span><span>确认录取后提交</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>《广西大学推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生复试申请表》（在我校研究生院网站下载专区下载）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>有公开发表的学术论文、科研成果或获奖证书者，提供复印件一份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>体检须提交二级甲等及以上医疗机构的体检表。本校推免生可选择在校医院进行体检。参加本年度推免的学生，如持有近</span> <span>1 个月内的有效体检报告，可提交复印件，不必再次体检。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span>材料整理及提交方式：所提供材料均采用</span><span>A4纸大小（成绩单可按所在学校格式），申请材料均需在复试前递交所申请学院研究生招生管理工作人员，一经收到，不再退还。</span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span> <span>入学前发现推免生提交不实材料而影响录取结果的，不予录取。</span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（二）复试环节</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>1.考核</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>形式：</span></span></strong><span><span>线上</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>2.</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>考核方式：</span></span></strong><span><span>复试以面试</span></span><span><span>提问</span></span><span><span>方式进</span></span><span><span>行。根据</span><span>“教育部推免服务系统”审核情况，分批次组织面试，具体时间和面试地点另行通知到个人。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>3.复试</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>考核内容</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>复试考核内容包括以下方面：</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>1．思想品德考核</span></span></strong><strong></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>思想政治和品德考核是保证入学新生质量的重要工作环节，学院在对考生复试的同时应询问和了解考生的政治态度、思想表现、工作学习态度、道德品质、遵纪守法、诚实守信等方面情况。</span></span><strong><span><span>思想品德考核不计入复试成绩，不合格者不予录取</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>2. </span></span><strong><span><span>专业考核（满分</span><span>100</span><span>分）</span></span></strong><strong></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>此项考核含</span></span><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>项内容：英语听说能力、专业基础能力、科研潜力及综合素质</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>学习规划</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>专业</span></span><span><span>考核各部分内容及权重为：</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>1</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>英语听说能力（</span><span>20分）：</span></span></strong><span><span>英语听说能力考核包含考生自述</span><span>(1分钟左右）以及与评委的英语交流；主要考查考生是否具备阅览英文文献，了解国际学科学术前沿的英语听说读写能力。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>2</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>专业基础能力</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>30分</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>：</span></span></strong><span><span>考查考生是否对专业基本概念、基本理论有准确理解；是否能用专业知识分析社会生活或生产实际的具体问题；是否能概括所学专业的知识体系；是否对学科发展的前沿领域有一定了解、研究生阶段是否奠定良好的学术规范等。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span><span>3）科研潜力及综合素养（40分）：</span></span></strong><span><span>考查考生科研创新精神和创新能力，责任感、纪律性、协作性以及人文素养、心理健康等</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>4</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>学习规划（</span><span>10分）：</span></span></strong><span><span>考生结合自身科研基础，阐述读研期间科研学习规划与预期目标。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>考生可选择自备</span><span>PPT，讲述时间限</span></span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>分钟。每</span></span><span><span>名考生</span></span><span><span>面试时间不少于</span></span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span>分钟，直博生重点考察科研潜力与博士研究设想。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>四、成绩与录取</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（一）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>复试成绩</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>复试成绩标准分（满分</span>100<span>分）</span><span>= </span><span>英语听说能力</span></span></strong><strong><span> </span></strong><strong><span>+</span></strong><strong><span> </span></strong><strong><span><span>专业基础能力</span></span></strong><strong><span> </span></strong><strong><span>+</span></strong><strong><span> </span></strong><strong><span><span>科研潜力及综合素质</span></span></strong><strong><span> <span>+ </span><span>学习规划</span></span></strong><strong></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>复试</span></span><span><span>成绩按百分制计算，精确到小数点后两位。</span></span><span><span>本科成绩、科研成果仅作参考，不折算复试分数。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>二</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>录取规则</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>1<span>）</span></span><strong><span><span>思想品德考核不合格者不予录取。</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>复试成绩未达到</span>60<span>分的不予录取。</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>直</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>博</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>生</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>复试成绩须达到</span><span>70分（含）以上</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>方能录取</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>2<span>）</span></span><span><span>复试</span></span><span><span>成绩为录取成绩。</span></span><span><span>在计划及比例限额内，</span></span><span><span>考生按</span></span><span><span>复试</span></span><span><span>成绩排名从高到低顺序</span></span><span><span>择优录取</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>复试</span></span><span><span>成绩相同的，</span></span><span><span>按</span></span><span><span>复试成绩精确到小数点后</span></span><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>位仍然相同，根据需要增加附加</span></span><span><span>面试</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span>3<span>）</span></span><span><span>直博生与推免硕士生不能直接互调。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>达到录取成绩要求人数超过</span></span><span><span>推免</span></span><span><span>指标数的，按分数高低依次候补。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>三</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>后续流程</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>拟录取名单在研究生院官网公示不少于</span> <span>7 个工作日，公示期间接受实名监督与异议，经核查属实的将取消拟录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>学院发送待录取通知后，考生须按时确认，逾期视为放弃。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>待录取考生入学前须取得本科毕业证、学位证；未取得证书、政审或体检不合格，取消录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>五、监督与申诉</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（一）过程监督</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>复试全过程录音录像，落实回避制度。材料按规定归档。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（二）申诉渠道</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>1.材料审核环节：相关争议由学院材料审核小组受理。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2.复试环节：相关申诉向学院招生工作小组提出。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span>监督举报方式：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>电气工程学院</span></span><span><span>招生咨询电话：</span><span>0771-3231080</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>电气工程学院监督举报电话：</span>0771-</span><span> </span><span>3360961</span></p>\n<p><span><span>电子邮箱：</span>gxudqjw@163.com</span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> <span>广西大学电气工程学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>                              <span>2026年9月15日</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>附录</span><span>1 </span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>广西大学博士研究生学业研修规划报告</span></span></strong></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>学科专业</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span> </span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>类</span></span></strong><strong><span><span> </span></span></strong><strong><span><span>型</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span> </span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）直博（）硕博连读</span> </span></strong><strong><span><span> </span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span><span> </span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）申请</span><span>-考核 </span></span></strong><strong><span><span> </span></span></strong></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>个人基本信息</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><p><strong><span><span>姓名，性别，年龄，民族，学习（本、硕）经历或（及）工作经历等</span></span></strong></p><p><span>  </span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>职业发展目标</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><p><strong><span><span>未来期望从事的行业领域及相应的工作性质内容等</span></span></strong><span> </span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>科研经历</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><p><strong><span><span>重点介绍曾经开展或正在开展的科学研究课题或技术推广项目的主要内容、取得的主要成绩等</span></span></strong></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><p><strong><span><span>研究计划</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><p><strong><span><span>介绍你关注的学科当前研究热点或行业难点痛点问题</span></span></strong></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><p><strong><span><span>拟解决关键技术问题或科学问题、研究基本思路、研究内容及研究方法，预期目标等</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span> </span></span></strong></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><p><strong><span><span>预期取得哪些创新性学术成果（学术成果应可量化可考核）</span></span></strong></p><p><span>  </span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><strong><span><span>个人诚信承诺</span></span></strong></p></td>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><p><strong><span><span>我保证报告所述内容真实，愿意在导师指导下实现预期目标，取得预期创新性学术成果。</span></span></strong></p><p><span>                 <span>            </span>   </span><span><span>申请人签字：</span></span><span><span>      <span>   </span>             </span></span></p><p><span>                                   <span>                  </span>   <span>  </span>  </span><span><span>年</span></span><span>     </span><span><span>月</span></span><span>     </span><span><span>日</span></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span><span>注：报告不少于</span></span><span>3000</span><span><span>字，正反面打印，页数不限。</span></span></p>\n</div>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"2b4092c3d62174b446cf7f1ed89a9b3979bd92f147c8695b0bca134aec2a58d7","textLength":2817,"sourceSha256":"67503dd221420ce58726d763b7655b86829108a283a8cf171053c20a91fcb0f2","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附录1：广西大学博士研究生学业研修规划报告.docx","url":"https://dqgc.gxu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1963497870&wbfileid=18227336"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d92c6105f74523470157","title":"2026年广西大学电气工程学院2027年接收推荐免试研究生（含直博生）复试录取工作细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:50.488407+00:00"}
